00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.523
that data along the way.

00:17:36.523 --> 00:17:38.190
So if you remember,
we found we're going

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.410
to use this CARS table here.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:42.940
And if you remember, we found
