00:17:44.598 --> 00:17:46.390
So what we're going to
do is we're actually

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:48.680
going to migrate that data.

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:51.190
So we're going to
export it from MySQL.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:53.410
And we're going to
